OL,3,ATrump administration sues to block
OL,4,Acertification of upcoming Alaska
OL,5,Aelection
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Trump administration wants to block
OL,8,Fthe certification of the Senate
OL,9,Felection in Alaska if Republican
OL,10,FSenator Dan Sullivan loses, arguing
OL,11,Fthat another candidate with the same
OL,12,Fname may confuse voters.
OL,14,FThe justice department said in a
OL,15,Ffederal lawsuit filed on Thursday that
OL,16,Fthe inclusion of another Dan Sullivan
OL,17,Fon the ballot could lead some to
OL,18,Fmistakenly cast their votes for the
OL,19,Fwrong candidate.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
